          "path": "/mnt/e/skillpilot-chemie-L7-20261017/current439-remediation14-guarded-root-integration-technical-v1/capsule/curricula/DE/Gymnasium/input/RP/upper-secondary/source-extraction/DE_RP_CHEMIE_SEKII_MSS_2022.source-extraction.json",
